  "s07": {
    "duration": 40.584,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "两个方向的数据都停了，但客户端还多挂着一个状态：时间等待。",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 55149040
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "它要等两倍的最长报文段寿命，才真正关闭。",
        "offset": 55649040,
        "duration": 40144232
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "原因有两条。",
        "offset": 95793272,
        "duration": 17067308
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "第一，最后那个确认可能丢。",
        "offset": 112860581,
        "duration": 25000000
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "丢了，服务端会重发终止报文。",
        "offset": 137860581,
        "duration": 31730770
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "还在时间等待的一方，能再补一个确认回去。",
        "offset": 169591352,
        "duration": 36177885
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "第二，等这段时间过去，这条连接残留的旧报文全部过期。",
        "offset": 205769238,
        "duration": 55288463
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "不会串到后面新建的连接上。",
        "offset": 261057701,
        "duration": 24038462
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "那为什么握手三次、挥手四次？",
        "offset": 285096164,
        "duration": 30288462
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "因为服务端收到终止报文时，自己的数据可能还没发完。",
        "offset": 315384626,
        "duration": 48317309
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "确认可以先回，终止必须等数据发完再发。",
        "offset": 363701936,
        "duration": 41586539
      }
    ],
