  "s16": {
    "duration": 27.216,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "什么时候认为网络拥塞了？",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 27144231
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "最硬的信号是超时。",
        "offset": 27644231,
        "duration": 21153846
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "超时说明连确认都回不来，路可能已经堵死。",
        "offset": 48798078,
        "duration": 41346155
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "处理办法：阈值砍一半。",
        "offset": 90144234,
        "duration": 25000000
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "拥塞窗口直接退回一个最大报文段。",
        "offset": 115144234,
        "duration": 32692308
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "然后重新走慢开始，从头慢慢试。",
        "offset": 147836543,
        "duration": 33774039
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "这一刀砍得很狠，因为超时是最严重的信号。",
        "offset": 181610583,
        "duration": 38822116
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "画在图上，就是锯齿状上升，超时处垂直落下。",
        "offset": 220432700,
        "duration": 51201924
      }
    ],
